memory remove chip rom_chip
memory remove chip variable_storage

memory create chip ram_chip 0x0800 8      
memory create chip rom_chip 0x2000 8     
memory create chip io_chip 0x0100 8       

memory create addressdecoder rom 0x0000 0x07ff ram_chip 0x0000 
memory create addressdecoder rom 0x8000 0x80ff io_chip  0x0000 
memory create addressdecoder rom 0xe000 0xffff rom_chip 0x0000 

